* An address in parentheses without a register (move.l (4),a5) is an absolute long address in
* r68, as a bare one; gas took (4) for a short one.
* fixed: ad95f7e 2026-10-11 r68togas: an address in parentheses is long
* expect text: 2a790000 00042a79 00000006 4a390000 00044ed5 20154e71
 psect paren_address,0,0,0,0,0
X equ 4
 move.l (4),a5
 move.l (X+2),a5
 tst.b (4)
 jmp (a5)
 move.l (a5),d0
 ends
